# SurgeonAI Frontend - AI Generation Rules

1. TECH STACK: React 18, Vite, Tailwind CSS.
2. STATE MANAGEMENT: EXCLUSIVELY use `zustand`. NO Context API. NO Redux.
3. STYLING (Anti-Gravity Aesthetic): 
   - Floating panels using `absolute` positioning.
   - Glassmorphism backgrounds: `bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-md`.
   - Sharp, glowing borders using Tailwind ring/border utilities.
   - High contrast text (`text-green-400`, `text-red-500`, `text-white`).
4. ANIMATION: Use `framer-motion` for all entrance/exit animations.
5. ARCHITECTURE: The background video stream (`<img src="http://localhost:5000/video" />`) MUST be completely isolated from Zustand state so it NEVER re-renders.
